      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 404,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4143,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve will be addressed[2], “Allah’s abhorrence of you when you were called to believe but you disbelieved was greater than your abhorrence of yourselves [Today].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4144,
      "text": "They will say, “Our Lord, You have caused us to die twice[3] and brought us to life twice. Now we acknowledge our sins; is there any way out?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4145,
      "text": "[They will be told], “This is because when Allah was invoked alone, you disbelieved, but when others were associated with Him, you believed. The judgment belongs to Allah, the Most High, the All-Great.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4146,
      "text": "It is He Who shows you His signs and sends down for you provision from the sky, but none will take heed except those who turn to Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4147,
      "text": "So call upon Allah with sincere devotion to Him, even if the disbelievers may dislike it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 40,
        "name": "سُورَةُ غَافِرٍ",
        "englishName": "Ghafir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Forgiver",
        "numberOfAyahs": 85,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 468,
      "ruku": 405,
      "hizbQuarter": 187,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4148,
      "text": "He is Exalted in Rank, Lord of the Throne. He sends down the revelation by His command to whom He wills of His slaves, in order to warn of the Day of Meeting,",
